# KeepScore
# Root-anchored: assets/.env is tracked on purpose. SUPABASE_URL,
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY and the AUTH_* flags are safe to ship (RLS
# protects the data, not this key) and env.dart refuses to run if a real
# secret ever lands in it.
/.env
.supabase.local
.supabase/

